{"seq":2,"slug":"referral-measurement-incrementality-experiment","title":"推荐度量与增量实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-measurement-incrementality-experiment","wordCount":2746,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐度量与增量实验设计\">推荐度量与增量实验设计</h1><p>推荐项目的运营看板从来不缺数字：邀请数、绑定数、被邀请人首单数、发出奖励金额，后台实时刷新。问题是它们回答不了唯一重要的那个问题——<strong>这笔奖励预算如果不花，这批订单会不会照样发生</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归因报表-指标漏斗与-k-因子\">核心概念：归因报表、指标漏斗与 K 因子</h2><p>归因报表的计量单位是&quot;事件被归到了哪个推荐关系&quot;，它天然对一切成功事件计数，也对一切本来就会发生的行为计数。推荐场景下这个偏差被系统性放大：愿意点开朋友推荐码的人本就是意向更高的一群人。因此度量体系必须同时维护<strong>两套口径</strong>——运营口径（快、可拆分，用于日常监控）与决策口径（慢、需实验，用于预算分配），<strong>只有后者能进入预算决策</strong>。漏斗指标把&quot;发出一张码&quot;到&quot;拿到一笔增量毛利&quot;拆成可归因的四层，每层分母必须是上一层，否则改动无法定位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[触点层&lt;br/&gt;邀请码曝光/复制/分享] --&gt; B[关系层&lt;br/&gt;绑定关系建立]&#10;  B --&gt; C[接受率 c&lt;br/&gt;被邀请人达成资格动作]&#10;  C --&gt; D[行为层&lt;br/&gt;首单/复购/留存]&#10;  D --&gt; E[价值层&lt;br/&gt;增量毛利 GM]&#10;  E --&gt; F[iROI = 增量毛利 / 期望成本]&#10;  A --&gt; G[K 因子&lt;br/&gt;K = i × c]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[病毒周期 t_cycle&lt;br/&gt;K &lt; 1 时规模收敛]\">graph TD\n  A[触点层&lt;br/&gt;邀请码曝光/复制/分享] --&gt; B[关系层&lt;br/&gt;绑定关系建立]\n  B --&gt; C[接受率 c&lt;br/&gt;被邀请人达成资格动作]\n  C --&gt; D[行为层&lt;br/&gt;首单/复购/留存]\n  D --&gt; E[价值层&lt;br/&gt;增量毛利 GM]\n  E --&gt; F[iROI = 增量毛利 / 期望成本]\n  A --&gt; G[K 因子&lt;br/&gt;K = i × c]\n  C --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[病毒周期 t_cycle&lt;br/&gt;K &lt; 1 时规模收敛]</pre><p>K 因子衡量&quot;推荐自身能带来多少新用户&quot;，定义在新用户视角：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = i \\times c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是每个新用户在生命周期内发出的有效邀请数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是被邀请人到资格动作的接受率。补上<strong>病毒周期</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>cycle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{cycle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（从注册到发出首邀的平均天数）才能算增长速率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时推荐链总获客收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\infty} = N_0/(1-K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 时 1 万个种子最多带来约 1.67 万个总用户；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近 1 才可能出现指数曲线，而电商推荐几乎没有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K\\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的案例。它写进看板的价值在于<strong>阻止把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的短期波动误读为趋势</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的分子含作弊行为时会虚高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>反作弊校验点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触点层</td>\n<td>邀请码曝光、复制、分享次数</td>\n<td>客户端埋点</td>\n<td>漏斗诊断、入口优化</td>\n<td>曝光去重、设备指纹、异常频次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系层</td>\n<td>绑定对数、接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、K 因子</td>\n<td>推荐关系表</td>\n<td>传播能力评估</td>\n<td>同设备/同 IP 聚簇、注册间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为层</td>\n<td>被邀请人首单率、30 日留存、客单价</td>\n<td>订单与行为表</td>\n<td>质量度量，区分好差量</td>\n<td>退款率、异常时段集中度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值层</td>\n<td>增量毛利、增量 CAC、iROI</td>\n<td>随机对照实验</td>\n<td>预算与奖励面值决策</td>\n<td>实验组污染、SRM 检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"干扰与溢出-推荐实验的随机化单元\">干扰与溢出：推荐实验的随机化单元</h2><p>推荐实验与普通 A/B 最大的结构差异是<strong>干扰</strong>：用户不是彼此独立的实验单元，他们之间存在推荐关系边。若把参考人 A 分进实验组、其朋友 B 分进对照组，A 的邀请行为仍会改变 B 的行为——B 虽在对照组却收到了邀请，这会把对照组的&quot;自然转化&quot;抬高，直接<strong>低估</strong>增量；更隐蔽的是逆向溢出，对照组用户被邀请后反过来去邀请别人。因此随机化单元必须与干扰半径匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>随机化单元</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>干扰处理</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户级（user-level）</td>\n<td>推荐关系稀疏、朋友间无交叉</td>\n<td>忽略或缓冲期隔离</td>\n<td>最省样本，最易污染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双边随机（two-sided / dyad）</td>\n<td>参考人与被邀请人都可随机</td>\n<td>对&quot;边&quot;两端施加同一分支</td>\n<td>破坏真实分享语境，需影子入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图簇随机（graph cluster）</td>\n<td>存在稠密社群（同校、同品类圈）</td>\n<td>对社群整体分配分支，簇间无重叠</td>\n<td>有效样本量下降，需更多簇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理/时间随机（geo / switchback）</td>\n<td>奖励是全局政策、无法按人随机</td>\n<td>市场或时段整体切换</td>\n<td>对照单元少，需回归类估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断规则是：<strong>先估干扰强度，再选单元</strong>。干扰强度用&quot;对照组用户中收到邀请的比例&quot;近似——超过 5%，用户级随机基本不可信。图簇随机的代价是<strong>设计效应</strong>：设簇内相关系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均簇大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，同类样本量下的方差膨胀因子约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DEFF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DEFF} = 1 + (m-1)\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DEFF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=0.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span></span> 时 DEFF 约 2，有效样本量减半——这是&quot;图簇随机更干净但要更贵&quot;的量化表达，也是跨境推荐实验常见的预算瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计与推断-srm-序贯检验与方差缩减\">实验设计与推断：SRM、序贯检验与方差缩减</h2><p>推荐实验跑起来后，第一件该检查的事不是显著性，而是<strong>样本比例是否与分配比例一致</strong>（Sample Ratio Mismatch, SRM）。它常被当作配置 bug，但推荐场景还有一个反作弊含义：<strong>机器人或批量注册账号会系统性地落入某一分支</strong>。检测用卡方统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = \\sum_g (O_g - E_g)^2/E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1002em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，偏离超过阈值（常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&lt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>）即判 SRM，此时<strong>指标差异不可信，必须先查分流</strong>。Microsoft ExP 团队的处置清单是行业参考（<a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/diagnosing-sample-ratio-mismatch-in-online-controlled-experiments-a-taxonomy-and-rules-of-thumb-for-practitioners/\">Microsoft Research, Diagnosing Sample Ratio Mismatch in Online Controlled Experiments</a>）。</p>\n<p>推荐看板是<strong>连续监控</strong>的，这带来第二个问题：每天偷看显著性、&quot;看到显著就停&quot;会把第一类错误率从 5% 抬到远高于 5%。合规做法二选一——<strong>固定样本量</strong>（预先算好 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 再开跑），或<strong>始终有效推断</strong>（always-valid inference），用混合序贯检验让任意时点停止都保持名义错误率（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.04922\">Johari et al., Always Valid Inference, arXiv:1512.04922</a>）；跨境团队尤其需要后者，因为奖励面值往往按月调整。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>方差缩减</strong>。推荐指标分母（被邀请人数）比分子（增量毛利）小得多，比率型指标不能直接套用均值检验；对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{Y}/\\bar{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 用 Delta method 近似方差是工业标准：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Var}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\bar{Y}}{\\bar{X}}\\right) \\approx \\frac{1}{n\\bar{X}^2}\\left(\\operatorname{Var}(Y) - 2\\frac{\\bar{Y}}{\\bar{X}}\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y) + \\left(\\frac{\\bar{Y}}{\\bar{X}}\\right)^2\\operatorname{Var}(X)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4471em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7101em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7101em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7101em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7101em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7011em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.95em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.06336\">Deng, Knoblich, Lu, Applying the Delta Method in Metric Analytics, arXiv:1803.06336</a>）忽略协方差项会把方差算错，进而把不显著报成显著。样本不足时再用 CUPED：取实验前协变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（推荐场景首选&quot;参考人历史分享次数&quot;，既预测转化又不受当前活动影响），残差化后剩余方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Corr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{Var}(Y)(1-\\operatorname{Corr}(X,Y)^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Corr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，强相关指标实测可降 30%–50% 方差（<a href=\"https://exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfControlledExperiments.pdf\">Deng et al., CUPED</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量可信度-反作弊校验与守门指标\">度量可信度：反作弊校验与守门指标</h2><p>测出来的增量如果是作弊刷出来的，比没测更危险——它会把预算导向一条可以被人为制造的增长曲线。因此推荐度量必须内置<strong>守门指标（guardrail metrics）</strong>，与主指标并列，任一恶化即判实验失败：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量守门</strong>：被邀请人的 30 日留存、退款率、客单价相对自然流量（organic）的比值。真推荐用户与自然流量结构接近；刷出来的账号所在订单退款率畸高或集中在小额。</li>\n<li><strong>成本守门</strong>：实际核销成本 / 预算成本、奖励撤回（clawback）率。撤回率突增说明大量资格事后被推翻，通常对应作弊账号被清算。</li>\n<li><strong>公平守门</strong>：被邀请人的地域/设备/支付方式分布是否与历史一致。若突然集中到少数设备指纹或 IP 段，即使指标达标也应暂停。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>另一支柱是<strong>跨来源核对</strong>：客户端埋点、服务端推荐关系表、奖励台账三方应能对上；差额不收敛时优先信任服务端与台账，因为埋点最容易被脚本伪造。<strong>度量口径的权威源是台账与关系表</strong>，埋点只用于漏斗诊断，台账模型见 <a href=\"../reward-ledger-fulfillment-operations/reward-ledger-accounting-model\">奖励台账记账模型</a>。</p>\n<p>监管侧同样收紧了边界。FTC 2024 年生效的<strong>虚假评论与推荐规则</strong>把&quot;买卖虚假推荐、未披露的重大利益关系&quot;列为可处罚行为（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2024/08/federal-trade-commission-announces-final-rule-banning-fake-reviews-testimonials\">FTC, Final Rule Banning Fake Reviews and Testimonials</a>），社媒推荐还须披露与品牌的实质关系（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/disclosures-101-social-media-influencers\">FTC, Disclosures 101</a>）。含义是：<strong>&quot;任务型刷量&quot;既污染实验也触碰监管</strong>，守门指标应监控&quot;同一付款方批量触发推荐&quot;的模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模化-多市场实验-地理估计与隐私约束\">规模化：多市场实验、地理估计与隐私约束</h2><p>推荐项目扩到多市场时，度量体系会撞上两个硬约束。第一是<strong>样本量分布极不均</strong>：主力市场能跑用户级实验，长尾小市场连对照组都凑不齐。此时用<strong>地理实验 + 时间回归</strong>估计累计因果效应——Google 的 time-based regression 明确把设计目标定为&quot;只有少数甚至单个对照市场&quot;（<a href=\"https://research.google/pubs/estimating-ad-effectiveness-using-geo-experiments-in-a-time-based-regression-framework/\">Google Research, Estimating Ad Effectiveness Using Geo Experiments in a Time-Based Regression Framework</a>），正适合中小跨境市场；代价是结论依赖模型假设。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>隐私约束对度量链路的改造</strong>。Chrome 的第三方 cookie 淘汰计划已被官方调整——2025 年 4 月的公告确认不再按原计划移除第三方 cookie，部分 Privacy Sandbox 技术被逐步下线（<a href=\"https://privacysandbox.com/news/privacy-sandbox-next-steps/\">Privacy Sandbox, Next steps for Privacy Sandbox, 2025-04</a>）。度量设计因此不能把&quot;跨站 ID 一定能拿到&quot;当前提：跨端归因应优先依赖<strong>登录态 ID 与服务端关系表</strong>。合规侧还须注意 GDPR 与 CCPA 对实验分组的约束——把用户分入对照组并抑制其功能，在部分辖区属于需要告知的处理行为（<a href=\"https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-topic/data-protection_en\">European Commission, Data Protection</a>、<a href=\"https://oag.ca.gov/privacy/ccpa\">California Attorney General, CCPA</a>）。</p>\n<p>还有一个反直觉结论：<strong>市场越多，越不该用统一阈值判定成败</strong>。同一奖励面值在高客单市场可能 iROI 达标、在低客单市场严重亏损，用全局均值决策会同时犯错；可行做法是按市场分层报告 iROI 与守门指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>归因口径与决策口径必须分开：前者做日常监控与漏斗诊断，后者（随机实验）才能进入预算决策，混用是度量事故主因。</li>\n<li>K 因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=i\\times c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 与病毒周期共同决定推荐能否自驱；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时规模收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_0/(1-K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，不要当趋势指标解读。</li>\n<li>推荐实验的核心难题是<strong>干扰</strong>：随机化单元与干扰半径匹配，先估&quot;对照组收到邀请的比例&quot;，超过 5% 就放弃用户级随机；图簇随机的代价是 DEFF 方差膨胀。</li>\n<li>报告显著性前先做 <strong>SRM 卡方检查</strong>，它同时是分流 bug 与机器人集中分流的探针；连续监控场景用始终有效推断替代偷看。</li>\n<li>比率型指标用 Delta method 估方差、用 CUPED 降方差；守门指标（质量/成本/公平）与主指标并列，任一恶化即判失败。</li>\n<li>多市场用地理实验 + 时间回归；跨端归因应优先依赖登录态与服务端关系，而非第三方 cookie。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>度量口径的上游是推荐关系的生命周期与身份拼接，见 <a href=\"../referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-relation-lifecycle-expiry\">推荐关系生命周期与过期</a>；增量毛利如何进入 iROI 判断，见 <a href=\"../referral-program-model-incentive-design/referral-incentive-economics-incrementality\">推荐激励经济学与增量测算</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐度量与增量实验设计","id":"推荐度量与增量实验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归因报表、指标漏斗与 K 因子","id":"核心概念-归因报表-指标漏斗与-k-因子"},{"level":2,"text":"干扰与溢出：推荐实验的随机化单元","id":"干扰与溢出-推荐实验的随机化单元"},{"level":2,"text":"实验设计与推断：SRM、序贯检验与方差缩减","id":"实验设计与推断-srm-序贯检验与方差缩减"},{"level":2,"text":"度量可信度：反作弊校验与守门指标","id":"度量可信度-反作弊校验与守门指标"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化：多市场实验、地理估计与隐私约束","id":"规模化-多市场实验-地理估计与隐私约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐反作弊与风控识别模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-fraud-risk-control-model"},"next":{"title":"推荐系统规模化与架构治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-system-scale-architecture-governance"}}